{"type":"text","timestamp":1788157970089,"sessionID":"ses_fa97b0f74ffeEV8MBzx1LkI1xy","part":{"id":"prt_056854316001KKW0x3AzTdLKpI","messageID":"msg_056853ab8001SdEocs44VcicHi","sessionID":"ses_fa97b0f74ffeEV8MBzx1LkI1xy","type":"text","text":"The evidence converges on `auth-gateway`: the post-deploy issuer/JWKS change rejects `partner-v2`, propagating 401s through `payment-api` to checkout. The database CPU spike and CDN image errors are observed but disconnected from the failed checkout path.","time":{"start":1788157969174,"end":1788157970083},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_06cb62550306c687016a952010fe4087d29c9077e8a803ac73","phase":"commentary"}}}}
